<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Tab.Robotics>机器人</ColonyKit.Settings.Tab.Robotics>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Hint>这里的开关和阈值会立即应用到所有保姆机器人；单台机器人的暂停、召回、前往、改名和涂装在选中机器人后操作。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Hint>

	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Section.Chores>家务</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Section.Chores>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Sweep>扫地（基地内）</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Sweep>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Sweep.Desc>清理家区域内的污渍。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Sweep.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Scrub>清洁（基地外）</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Scrub>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Scrub.Desc>清理家区域外的污渍，适合战后打扫。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Scrub.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Haul>搬运</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Haul>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Haul.Desc>把散落物品送进立体库或普通库存区；不搬尸体。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Haul.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Firefight>灭火</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Firefight>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Firefight.Desc>扑灭工作范围内的火。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Firefight.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Butcher>屠宰尸体</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Butcher>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Butcher.Desc>使用屠宰台上的屠宰账单处理尸体。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Butcher.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Refuel>给发电机加燃料</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Refuel>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Refuel.Desc>给木柴发电机、化合燃料发电机补充燃料。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Refuel.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.FeedPrisoners>给囚犯送餐</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.FeedPrisoners>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.FeedPrisoners.Desc>给饥饿的殖民地囚犯喂食或送餐。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.FeedPrisoners.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Hygiene>卫生维护</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Hygiene>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Hygiene.Desc>清空化粪池、疏通堵塞洁具；即使扫地关闭，也会优先处理卫生间地面污渍。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Hygiene.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Storage>直送立体库</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Storage>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Storage.Desc>搬运时优先把物品直接送进立体库。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Storage.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Rescue>优先救援</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Rescue>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Rescue.Desc>发现殖民地人员倒地时，优先抱回床上。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Rescue.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.DangerAvoidance>危险规避</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.DangerAvoidance>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.DangerAvoidance.Desc>附近有敌人或全图高危险时，停止家务并回充电桩待命。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.DangerAvoidance.Desc>

	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Section.Parameters>参数</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Section.Parameters>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.ChargeThreshold>充电阈值</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.ChargeThreshold>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.BatteryCapacity>电池容量</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.BatteryCapacity>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.RefuelThreshold>加燃料阈值</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.RefuelThreshold>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.WorkRadius>工作半径</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.WorkRadius>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Unlimited>不限</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Unlimited>

	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Section.Area>工作区域</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Section.Area>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.AreaMode>区域模式</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.AreaMode>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Area.Unrestricted>不限</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Area.Unrestricted>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Area.Home>仅家区域</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Area.Home>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Area.Custom>自定义区域</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Area.Custom>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.AreaLabel>区域名称</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.AreaLabel>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.AreaLabel.Desc>填写地图上区域的名字；找不到时按「不限」处理。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.AreaLabel.Desc>

	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Section.Maintenance>维护与表现</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Section.Maintenance>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.DurabilityHint>耐久上限 1000。工作时缓慢损耗，耐久为 0 时会报废成钢和零部件；殖民者可在「建造」工作中维修。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.DurabilityHint>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Sounds>滴滴声</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Sounds>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Sounds.Desc>机器人工作时偶尔发出提示音；低电时只提醒一次。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.Sounds.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.ChargingGlow>充电光效</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.ChargingGlow>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.ChargingGlow.Desc>机器人对接充电时，充电桩发出淡蓝色光。</ColonyKit.Settings.Robotics.ChargingGlow.Desc>

