	<CK.Robotics.Command.Pause>暂停家务</CK.Robotics.Command.Pause>
	<CK.Robotics.Command.Resume>继续家务</CK.Robotics.Command.Resume>
	<CK.Robotics.Command.Pause.Desc>暂停自动找活；危险规避仍会生效。</CK.Robotics.Command.Pause.Desc>
	<CK.Robotics.Command.Recall>召回充电桩</CK.Robotics.Command.Recall>
	<CK.Robotics.Command.Recall.Desc>回到最近的充电桩旁边待命。</CK.Robotics.Command.Recall.Desc>
	<CK.Robotics.Command.Goto>前往指定位置</CK.Robotics.Command.Goto>
	<CK.Robotics.Command.Goto.Desc>点选一个格子，让机器人走过去。</CK.Robotics.Command.Goto.Desc>
	<CK.Robotics.Command.PrioritizeFilth>优先清理…</CK.Robotics.Command.PrioritizeFilth>
	<CK.Robotics.Command.PrioritizeFilth.Desc>点选一块污渍，让机器人立刻去清理。</CK.Robotics.Command.PrioritizeFilth.Desc>
	<CK.Robotics.Command.Rename>改名</CK.Robotics.Command.Rename>
	<CK.Robotics.Command.Rename.Desc>修改这台机器人的名字。</CK.Robotics.Command.Rename.Desc>
	<CK.Robotics.Command.Paint>涂装</CK.Robotics.Command.Paint>
	<CK.Robotics.Command.Paint.Desc>选择机器人外壳颜色。</CK.Robotics.Command.Paint.Desc>

