	<CK.Robotics.Station.Locate>定位机器人</CK.Robotics.Station.Locate>
	<CK.Robotics.Station.Locate.Desc>镜头跳到这台机器人当前所在的位置。</CK.Robotics.Station.Locate.Desc>
	<CK.Robotics.Station.Recall>召回机器人</CK.Robotics.Station.Recall>
	<CK.Robotics.Station.Recall.Desc>让绑定的机器人回到工作站旁边。</CK.Robotics.Station.Recall.Desc>

